**Issue to Validate:**
Dimension: Design
Severity: Major
Location: models/spring-ai-mistral-ai/src/main/java/org/springframework/ai/mistralai/api/MistralAiApi.java::1240
Title: Inconsistent use of sealed interfaces for polymorphic types
Description: While `ContentChunk` is defined as a `sealed interface`, the nested `ThinkingContentChunk` is also sealed, but the hierarchy requires manual mapping in `ContentDeserializer` and `ContentSerializer`. The deep nesting and manual switch-like serialization logic make the domain model difficult to extend.
Assumption: The codebase prefers type safety and clean hierarchy navigation over manual serialization logic.

